File permissions in Linux
Project description
As a security analyst, I use this project to determine whether the permissions match the authorisation that should be granted. If they do not match, I will modify the permissions to authorize the appropriate users and remove any unauthorised access. This helps me implement the principle of least access to protect files from unauthorized users
Describe the permissions string
Drwxrwxrwx
D is for drectory
The first rwx is for the user permissions
The second rwx is the group permissions
The third rwx is for other permissions
r-read
w-write
x-execute

